  "notes": "Azure Latch is a 5v5 soccer game on Roblox inspired by the Blue Lock anime, made by the Azure Latch Team group. You play with a style based on characters like Isagi, Nagi or Kaiser, then dribble, tackle, shoot and dive in goal as you try to outscore the other team. Each style comes with its own skills, so knowing when to use them matters as much as speed.\n\nCodes mostly give Style Coins and Cash, plus a few emotes. Style Coins are the best reward because they pay for style spins, and your style decides your whole moveset. New codes usually come out after character reworks, maintenance or bug fixes, and when the game reaches a player count goal, so check the Discord after each shutdown. Older codes tend to stop working once the next batch arrives.",
