  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "Why does an Azure Latch code say invalid?",
      "a": "Codes here expire quickly, often right after the next update. Every Azure Latch code is in capital letters, so type it in all caps or copy and paste it."
    },
    {
      "q": "What should I spend Style Coins on in Azure Latch?",
      "a": "Use them on style spins first, since your style decides your skills on the pitch. Keep spinning until you get a style that fits how you like to play."
    },
    {
      "q": "When do new Azure Latch codes come out?",
      "a": "They usually show up after a shutdown for an update or fix, after a character rework, or when the game hits a new player count milestone."
    }
  ],
